WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.627
Open Treasury and choose the correct service.

00:00:04.877 --> 00:00:08.629
Select the category, payment method and currency, then enter

00:00:08.629 --> 00:00:09.463
the amount.

00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:11.485
Choose a giver when required.

00:00:11.735 --> 00:00:13.913
Cash needs two distinct counters.

00:00:14.163 --> 00:00:17.159
Select Record collection and wait for confirmation.

00:00:17.409 --> 00:00:20.551
The other authorized reviewer checks the entry and confirms

00:00:20.551 --> 00:00:20.900
it.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.444
Pending and confirmed totals are different.

00:00:23.694 --> 00:00:26.813
Record a bank deposit separately and have the other

00:00:26.813 --> 00:00:29.239
reviewer verify it against the bank record.

00:00:29.489 --> 00:00:33.091
If a save is unverified, retry the same details

00:00:33.091 --> 00:00:35.092
instead of creating another collection.
